1
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,000
A castle.

2
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,759
A group of children.

3
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:47,960
Secrets hidden for too long.

4
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:54,039
The truth has been turned upside down.

5
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:59,440
The bad guys have been seen through.

6
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,920
A shadow comes

7
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,400
for revenge.

8
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,320
My name is Li Zhiwei,

9
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:15,040
a science fiction writer.

10
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,840
Countless rejected manuscripts

11
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,720
pile up into silent tombstones,

12
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:23,500
recording a ten-year lonely journey of being misunderstood.

13
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,120
This book, 'The Death of Marat'.

14
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,000
It became my last attempt and hope.

15
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,120
Where are the pain points, the explosive points, and the highlights?

16
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,240
You've been writing for ten years.

17
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,160
If you don't listen to me,

18
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:36,290
you'll only be able to pick up leftovers like a dog for the rest of your life.

19
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,520
Zhiwei, you're famous.

20
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,440
Your "The Death of Marat" has been nominated for the Xinghe Award.

21
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:49,800
And big companies want to buy the film and TV rights at a high price.

22
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,930
I thought the day to turn my life around had finally come.

23
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,280
But I didn't expect

24
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:03,200
that the plot in the novel

25
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:17,800
would all happen to me.

26
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:48,440
I followed the plot of "The Death of Marat".

27
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:52,960
At the celebration party the day before this book's release,

28
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:55,920
I traveled six hours into the future.

29
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,320
The entire villa was completely empty.

30
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,850
What's even more terrifying is...

31
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,490
What's even more terrifying is

32
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,140
that I saw myself six hours later,

33
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:31,320
with a steak knife stuck in my chest,

34
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:34,040
dead on the eve of my success.

35
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,800
This ending,

36
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,240
I don't like it.

37
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,560
Mara is not dead.

38
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,640
If you believe that what has happened

39
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,920
is the only thing that could happen,

40
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,480
you might feel less pain and regret.

41
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,560
Why does singing that nursery rhyme

42
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,000
cause the universe and time to overlap

43
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,280
and allow time travel?

44
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,160
Just treat it as a plot device.

45
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:34,080
It's nothing more than using fake stories

46
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,940
to evoke emotions and make money.

47
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,120
It's no different from your acting.

48
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,480
I'm different.

49
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:45,280
Whether on or off screen,

50
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,320
I can hold nothing back

51
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:49,920
and show all my true feelings.

52
00:05:58,200 --> 00:06:00,080
If the talk with Mr. Dai goes well today,

53
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,210
I will definitely give you a surprise.

54
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,080
The sun is setting.

55
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:06,600
The party is about to start.

56
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,520
Let's go.

57
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,880
It's convenient to go in and out anyway,

58
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:16,400
right?

59
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,520
Mr. Dai.

60
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,280
My big sponsor is here.

61
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,960
Come, let me introduce you.

62
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:27,280
This is the most popular sci-fi novelist right now,

63
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:29,810
the author of 'The Death of Marat', Li Zhiwei.

64
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,120
Come, take a look.

65
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:34,000
Look at these little money-making hands.

66
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,200
Once he sits in front of the computer...

67
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,090
You think you're typing words?

68
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,440
You're typing money.

69
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,570
Impressive.

70
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,280
Let me introduce you.

71
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,200
Sophie,

72
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:48,180
the rising star of our entertainment industry.

73
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,680
Get her autograph later.

74
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,080
She's going to be famous.

75
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,520
Mr. Dai.

76
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:57,000
You guys chat. We'll head down the mountain first.

77
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,280
Okay, take care.

78
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:01,660
Mr. Dai,

79
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,320
this is...

80
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:02,600
Mr. Dai.

81
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,130
Xiaotao.

82
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:03,900
Mr. Dai.

83
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,760
Please come in. Let's talk inside.

84
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,480
Let's go.

85
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,600
Zhiwei, in your book,

86
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,000
to achieve time travel,

87
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,320
one must repeat the act of overlapping universes.

88
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,160
Where did you get this inspiration?

89
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:15,960
Interesting.

90
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:18,080
Also, we need to finalize this contract

91
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,210
as soon as possible.

92
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:21,760
Don't be too greedy.

93
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,920
Lock in the profits.

94
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,440
Although we won't make money on the copyright this time,

95
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,680
after I help you secure the Xinghe Award,

96
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:44,960
making money will be a piece of cake for you.

97
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:46,840
Yes, Mr. Dai.

98
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:49,200
But recently, a few companies approached me

99
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,680
to buy my film and television rights.

100
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,280
The prices they offered are pretty good.

101
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:53,409
So I was thinking...

102
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,280
Here's a little baby.

103
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,680
So cute.

104
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,530
Let me tell you, I used to have a dog too.

105
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,760
But I kept thinking, if I raise this thing,

106
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:05,640
when it grows up,

107
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:07,400
will it jump up and bite me?

108
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,400
Little baby.

109
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,080
Will you bite me?

110
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,360
If you dare to bite me,

111
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,360
I'll kill you.

112
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:27,080
Mr. Dai, you're always joking.

113
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,560
If this were made into a movie,

114
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,000
it would definitely be a big hit.

115
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,919
Give me a role when the time comes.

116
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:35,720
All it takes is a word.

117
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,440
Let me tell you.

118
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,159
You only have tonight.

119
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,480
Think about it carefully.

120
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,520
Mr. Dai.

121
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,039
Who is playing the piano?

122
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,080
An old friend.

123
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,360
Go inside and look at my collection.

124
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,240
Come, come.

125
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,040
Li Zhiwei.

126
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,160
Long time no see.

127
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:41,920
What?

128
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,080
Don't you recognize me?

129
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,960
No.

130
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,920
I'm glad to see you again.

131
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,770
These past three years,

132
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:09,720
have you ever hated me?

133
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,450
Three years is not a short time.

134
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,320
It can change a lot of things.

135
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,800
But I think

136
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,970
you haven't changed at all.

137
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,120
You've changed a lot.

138
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:30,200
If I left you with a wound,

139
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:32,920
it's not just yours,

140
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,160
it's mine too.

141
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:40,560
Mr. Dai, please stop joking.

142
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,640
We walked around the garden for a long time

143
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,680
but couldn't find you.

144
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,560
You came here to see Xiao'an.

145
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,240
Not bad.

146
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,720
Auntie.

147
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:53,360
Auntie?

148
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,680
Didn't you know?

149
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,360
An'an is my eldest niece.

150
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:02,520
If she hadn't gone abroad and left the house for us to live in,

151
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:06,520
how would we have had the chance to get to know each other and be together?

152
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:10,380
I didn't expect you to have such seniority, beautiful Sophie.

153
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:15,640
Xiao'an's father and I have been business partners for many years.

154
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,200
Don't make me sound old.

155
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:20,210
I'm only two months older than her.

156
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,880
Why didn't you tell me you were coming back?

157
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,240
I just landed today,

158
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,640
and Uncle Dai asked me to come here for a gathering.

159
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:31,040
How long are you staying?

160
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,450
I'm not leaving.

161
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:39,840
Welcome back,

162
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,040
Sister An'an.

163
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:48,920
Xiaofei.

164
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:55,560
Isn't it nice to be a food blogger abroad

165
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:58,000
and manage the business at home?

166
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,690
Why did you suddenly come back?

167
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:06,000
Some habits can't be changed

168
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,610
or forgotten just because you want to.

169
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:10,840
You really

170
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,680
came back for Li Zhiwei.

171
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,240
Do you really like him?

172
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,040
Or...

173
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:18,730
Because he wrote the story of Ma La.

174
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:26,280
Why did you mention Ma La?

175
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:28,320
I hope you can move on.

176
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:29,880
But I must remind you,

177
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:32,930
Li Zhiwei is not as simple as you think.

178
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:44,200
They are going crazy together. It's absolutely ridiculous.

179
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,240
Putting these two women together

180
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,880
is more terrifying than the plot in my book.

181
00:12:49,680 --> 00:12:54,520
The bad guy has been seen through.

182
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:57,000
A shadow comes

183
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,760
for revenge.

184
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:34,840
It's twelve o'clock.

185
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,360
Wasn't it just past six when I went in?

186
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,100
Where did everyone go?

187
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,600
Sophie!

188
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,440
Xiaotao!

189
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:47,960
How am I the only one left in the whole villa?

190
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:24,040
This is me.

191
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:25,560
I time-traveled.

192
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,370
Six hours later, I'm already dead.

193
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,280
If what the book says is true,

194
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:34,120
repeating the universe-overlapping behavior enables time travel.

195
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,440
It means I have to repeat

196
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,440
what I did before this point in time.

197
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:40,320
Achieving spatial overlap will let me go back.

198
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:43,840
I still have too many unfulfilled wishes.

199
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,280
I can't just die like this.

200
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:46,200
I must go back.

201
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,600
I need to find out who the killer is.

202
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:50,360
I also need to get my Xinghe Award

203
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,720
and everything I deserve.
